# {{PLUGIN_NAME}}

A plotdesk plugin.

## Installation

This plugin is installed via the plotdesk Plugin Management UI.

## Development

```bash
composer install
```

## Structure

- `plugin.json` - Plugin manifest
- `src/` - PHP source code
- `src/Apps/` - App classes (AI functions)
- `routes/` - Web and API routes
- `resources/lang/` - Translations
- `database/migrations/` - Database migrations
- `dist/` - Pre-built frontend assets (if applicable)
- `vendor/` - Composer dependencies (committed)
